From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:02:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wintrust: Replace a catalog of the same name in
 CryptCATAdminAddCatalog().

The catalog is made a system file, and copying over a hidden or system
file fails with ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED, as it does on Windows, so a driver
package installed a second time failed to copy its INF.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c b/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c
index ad6f264cffb..e7cea282127 100644
--- a/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c
+++ b/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c
@@ -238,6 +238,8 @@ HCATINFO WINAPI CryptCATAdminAddCatalog(HCATADMIN catAdmin, PWSTR catalogFile,
     lstrcatW(target, slashW);
     lstrcatW(target, selectBaseName);
 
+    /* a catalog of that name is replaced; being a system file, it is not overwritten as it is */
+    SetFileAttributesW(target, FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NORMAL);
     if (!CopyFileW(catalogFile, target, FALSE))
     {
         free(target);
